// ============================================================================
// ATOMIC ROADMAP CHECKLIST — Password & Passphrase Generator
// Source spec: scratch/message-attachments/password-generator-roadmap.md
// Rules: implement ONE task at a time (lowest unchecked number), validate it,
// mark it [x] below, then stop for review before the next task.
// ============================================================================

// PHASE 1 — Character-Based Password Engine
// [x] 1. Character Class Control: generate strings from toggles for uppercase,
//         lowercase, digits, and symbols.
// [x] 2. Exact Length Constraint: strict length requirement (8–64 chars).
// [x] 3. Ambiguous Character Filter: exclude visually similar chars (0 O 1 l I).
// [x] 4. Minimum Class Distribution: at least one char from every selected
//         class must appear in the output.
// [x] 5. Uniqueness Constraint: "no-repeating-characters" mode — no char
//         appears more than once in a single password.
// [x] 6. Pronounceable Mode: "readable" logic alternating consonant/vowel
//         patterns for a phonetic structure.

// PHASE 2 — Passphrase Engine
// [x] 7. Word List Integration: select between word dictionaries (Common
//         English / Technical / Random).
// [x] 8. Passphrase Composition: build a string from a configurable word count.
// [x] 9. Separator Logic: join words with space / hyphen / dot / none.
// [x] 10. Word Formatting: optional per-word capitalization (Title/Upper/Lower).
// [x] 11. Injection Logic: inject random digits or symbols at start, end, or
//          between words.

// PHASE 3 — Bulk Generation & Analysis
// [x] 12. Batch Generation: generate up to 50 passwords/passphrases at once.
// [x] 13. Entropy Calculation: bits of entropy per string from pool + length.
// [x] 14. Strength Meter: color-coded visual bar mapped to entropy values.
// [x] 15. Generation History: session log of most recently generated values.

// PHASE 4 — User Interface & UX
// [x] 16. Configuration Persistence: save/load user settings across refreshes.
// [x] 17. Visibility Toggle: peek/hide to mask generated passwords.
// [x] 18. Clipboard Integration: one-click copy per password.
// [x] 19. Export Functionality: download current bulk list as .txt.
// [x] 20. Live Config Panel: reactive settings panel updating parameters live.

// ============================================================================
// POST-ROADMAP EXTRAS — all complete.
// [x] E1. History persists across tab closes (localStorage bpg.history.v1).
// [x] E2. Per-row regenerate button in the bulk list.
// [x] E3. Export formats: TXT / CSV / JSON.
// [x] E4. Copy-on-generate option.
// [x] E5. Custom character sets (appended to the pool, persist in settings).
// [x] E6. ?test / #test URL flag runs an automated UI test suite.
// [x] E7. Accessibility pass: skip link, :focus-visible, aria-live output,
//         aria-hidden icons, prefers-reduced-motion.
// [x] E8. Keyboard shortcuts: G generate · C copy · M mask · P mode · ? help.
// [x] E9. Appearance popover: light/dark theme + accent colour palettes
//         (blue / teal / purple / rose / amber / emerald).
// [x] E10. $meta.image set for the listing / social card.

// ============================================================================
// Note: engine lives in src/passgen.js; UI markup + wiring in index.html.
// The visual theme/structure is adapted from the business-template.
// ============================================================================

$meta
  title = Business Password Generator
  description = A highly configurable password & passphrase generator for business and security teams. Character-class toggles, exact length, ambiguous-character exclusion, no-repeat and readable modes — all backed by cryptographic randomness.
  image = https://user.uploads.dev/file/1e70841689257b883699918c26b91f41.jpg
  tags = password, security, generator, tool, business, passphrase
  header
    mode = minimal

title = Business Password Generator
